---
import WhatsAppLogo from '../../icons/WhatsAppLogo.astro';
---

<section class="py-24 bg-primary px-margin-desktop relative overflow-hidden" id="join" aria-labelledby="comunidad-cta-title">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 scanner-line opacity-20" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center scroll-reveal">
    <div class="border-l-4 border-white pl-6 mb-8 inline-block text-left">
      <h3 id="comunidad-cta-title" class="font-headline-md text-3xl text-white mb-2 uppercase tracking-tight">
        ¿Listo para elevar tu perfil?
      </h3>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-white/90 uppercase tracking-widest">
        [URGENT_DEPLOYMENT]: Acceso libre, conocimiento compartido, defensa absoluta.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8">
      <a
        class="bg-white text-primary px-12 py-6 font-headline-sm text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] shadow-2xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-4"
        href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/HZeGVwNErr4DLnYzKxthKN"
      >
        <WhatsAppLogo class="w-8 h-8 fill-current" />
        Unete al equipo de WhatsApp
      </a>
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[10px] text-white/60">
        <span class="animate-pulse text-lg" aria-hidden="true">●</span>
        <span class="tracking-[0.4em] font-bold">ACCESO RESTRINGIDO A PERSONAL VERIFICADO</span>
        <span class="animate-pulse text-lg" aria-hidden="true">●</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>